#ASSERT `Under section 64(2B), may the Secretary of State extend the period by a further direction` FALSE (Date 1 3 2027) (Date 28 3 2027) EQUALS NOTHING -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `Under section 64(2B), may the Secretary of State extend the period by a further direction` FALSE (Date 1 3 2027) (Date 28 3 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE; the function is named for a power, the "in writing" complement failed, and the text limits the grant in its own words without saying no, so NOTHING, not JUST FALSE (fork 18)
#ASSERT `Under section 64(3), may the directors change the name by resolution to comply with the direction` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 64(3), may the directors change the name by resolution to comply with the direction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
