-- a solicitor who is not called or admitted anywhere in the United Kingdom: not (c)
#ASSERT `Under section 273(2), does the person have one or more of the qualifications the subsection lists` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no qualification, but the directors think the person capable by virtue of another position: qualification (d)
