-- default, but I am not in default
#ASSERT (`Under section 425(1)(b), do I commit an offence as an officer of the company in default because default was made in sending out copies?` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- no default
#ASSERT (`Under section 425(1)(b), do I commit an offence as an officer of the company in default because default was made in sending out copies?` FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum
#ASSERT (`Under section 425(2), what is the most I can be fined on summary conviction for that offence, in pounds?` 5000) EQUALS JUST 5000
