-- coa11-cases-seat.l4: cases for the seat layer coa11-seat.l4: one or more per question, with the facts a director, secretary
-- or member would state.  Every expected value is written by hand from the text of the section the question is about, beside the
-- assertion; none was copied from the encoding's output.  (The file is written by work/gen_seat_cases.py from a table of cases;
-- each unlisted input takes a neutral default: no, 0, 1 January 2025, or empty.)

