#ASSERT `Under section 487(1)(b), has the auditor of my private company ceased to hold office at the end of the next period for appointing auditors` (Date 12 10 2025) (Date 12 10 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE  -- the last day itself: the period has not yet ended
