#ASSERT `Under section 488(1), is the deemed re-appointment of the auditor of my private company prevented by the members' notices` 5 FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE  -- exactly 5%: "at least"
#ASSERT `Under section 488(1), is the deemed re-appointment of the auditor of my private company prevented by the members' notices` 4 FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
