-- ==== Companies Act 2006, Part 16 (Audit), Chapters 3 to 7 -- the questions of a director, secretary, member or person who deals with a company


-- ==== Chapter 3 -- the auditor's report and the auditor's rights (ss 495 to 509)

-- 495(1): a private company whose accounts are sent to members
