-- coa13-cases-seat.l4: cases for the seat layer coa13-seat.l4: one or more cases per question, in the facts a director, secretary or
-- member of a company would state. Every expected value is written from the text of the section in the question's name, before the run.
-- Every question has at least one case; each "not covered" case asserts NOTHING. The pounds for a fine's level are illustrative inputs.

§ `Cases for the seat of a director, secretary or member: Part 17, ss 540 to 609`

§§ `Chapter 1`

-- Priya, a director of a private limited company, finds a share with no fixed nominal value in the minutes (s 542(1)). Not covered for an unlimited company.
#ASSERT `Under section 542(1), does each share of my company meet the requirement of a fixed nominal value` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
