#ASSERT `Under section 790LA(3), by what day must my company give the registrar a notice of a confirmed person with significant control` (Date 5 1 2026) EQUALS Date 18 1 2026
-- The company believes a person has become a PSC and has no confirmation.
#ASSERT `Under section 790LC(1), must my company give the registrar a notice of a person it believes has become a person with significant control` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A notice on incorporation for someone in the statement of initial significant control: subsection (4).
#ASSERT `Under section 790LC(1), must my company give the registrar a notice of a person it believes has become a person with significant control` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The company has confirmation of a change and of how and when.
#ASSERT `Under section 790LD(1), must my company give the registrar a notice of a change in a person's required particulars` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Confirmed on 20 February 2026 (a non-leap year): 14 days end on 5 March.
#ASSERT `Under section 790LD(3), by what day must my company give the registrar a notice of the change` (Date 20 2 2026) EQUALS Date 5 3 2026
-- The company has confirmation that the person ceased and the date.
#ASSERT `Under section 790LF(1), must my company give the registrar a notice that a person has ceased to have significant control` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The company believes it has no PSC.
#ASSERT `Under section 790LH(1), must my company give the registrar a notice that it has no people with significant control` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

