#ASSERT `Under section 805(1), by what date must the company make the report available for inspection?` (Date 1 1 2026) (LIST (Date 6 1 2026)) EQUALS (Date 23 1 2026)
-- With no days off other than weekends: Thursday 22 January.
#ASSERT `Under section 805(1), by what date must the company make the report available for inspection?` (Date 1 1 2026) EMPTY EQUALS (Date 22 1 2026)
-- Three months ran out on 1 April and the investigation concluded on 2 April: one interim report.
