-- I had no reason to suspect misuse: not covered.
#ASSERT `Under section 814(2), do I commit an offence by disclosing information obtained from the register?` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The entry was made on 1 March 2020; today is 2 March 2026: more than six years.
#ASSERT `Under section 816, may the company remove an entry made more than six years ago?` (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 2 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
