§§ `Part 22: whether a person has an interest in shares (ss 820 to 825)`

-- I have contracted to buy the shares.
#ASSERT `Under section 820(4), am I treated as having an interest in the shares?` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- I am not the registered holder but I can exercise the votes.
#ASSERT `Under section 820(4), am I treated as having an interest in the shares?` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
