#ASSERT `Under section 822(1), am I taken to be interested in shares in which my family is interested?` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- No spouse or infant child interested: not covered.
#ASSERT `Under section 822(1), am I taken to be interested in shares in which my family is interested?` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- I control exactly one-third of the voting power of the company that holds them.
