-- s 859E(1) Table: a charge the Table does not describe has no date in the Table
#ASSERT (`Under section 859E(1), on what date is my charge taken to be created` WITH `how my charge was created` IS `s 859E a charge the Table does not describe`, `the date of the event the Table names` IS (Date 4 6 2025)) EQUALS NOTHING
