-- s 859A(4): the court has extended the period to 30 April 2025
#ASSERT (`Under section 859A(4), what is the last day for delivering the statement of particulars of my charge to the registrar` WITH `how my charge was created` IS `s 859E a charge created or evidenced by a deed that has been executed and has immediate effect on execution and delivery`, `the date of the event the Table names` IS (Date 1 3 2025), `a court has extended the period under section 859F(3)` IS TRUE, `the last day the court's order allows` IS (Date 30 4 2025)) EQUALS JUST (Date 30 4 2025)
-- s 859A(4): a charge the Table does not describe has no date, so no last day
#ASSERT (`Under section 859A(4), what is the last day for delivering the statement of particulars of my charge to the registrar` WITH `how my charge was created` IS `s 859E a charge the Table does not describe`, `the date of the event the Table names` IS (Date 1 3 2025), `a court has extended the period under section 859F(3)` IS FALSE, `the last day the court's order allows` IS (Date 1 1 2000)) EQUALS NOTHING
