#ASSERT `Under section 947(2), did I comply with the Takeover Panel's notice at the right place and in time` (Date 14 3 2027) (Date 15 3 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 947(2), did I comply with the Takeover Panel's notice at the right place and in time` (Date 14 3 2027) (Date 10 3 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Case: private affairs of a living individual, given to the Panel; no consent, no Schedule 2 exception, not public (s 948(2)).
#ASSERT `Under section 948, am I prohibited from disclosing this information that was given to the Takeover Panel` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Case: the disclosure helps the Panel carry out its functions (s 948(3)(a): (2) does not apply).
#ASSERT `Under section 948, am I prohibited from disclosing this information that was given to the Takeover Panel` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Case: the information is available to the public from another source (s 948(8)).
