#ASSERT `Under section 948, am I prohibited from disclosing this information that was given to the Takeover Panel` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Case: the individual consented: the prohibition is of disclosure without consent, and the text says nothing about this case.
#ASSERT `Under section 948, am I prohibited from disclosing this information that was given to the Takeover Panel` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Case: it is not known whether Schedule 2 Part 1 lists the recipient: not covered.
