#ASSERT `Under section 948, am I prohibited from disclosing this information that was given to the Takeover Panel` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` `Under sections 942 to 993 it is not so` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
