-- My supervisory authority has not confirmed that I am known to and supervised by it: no.
#ASSERT `Under section 1098B(4), must the registrar grant my application to become an authorised corporate service provider` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
