-- A company applying through a member of the body: not a relevant officer for a company.
#ASSERT `Under section 1098D, is my firm's application delivered in the way the Act requires` `s 1098D a company` FALSE `s 1098D a member of the body` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A director who is an individual but gives no statement of status.
#ASSERT `Under section 1098D, is my firm's application delivered in the way the Act requires` `s 1098D a company` FALSE `s 1098D a director` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A change on 1 March 2026 with no regulation 7(2) agreement: notify by 14 March 2026.
