-- An agreement not yet notified or published: no period is running.
#ASSERT `Under section 1098E(1), by what date must I notify the registrar of the change in my supervisory authority` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) EQUALS NOTHING
