#ASSERT `Under section 1098E(3), have I committed an offence by not notifying the registrar of the change in my supervisory authority in time` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 30 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- I notified on 14 March 2026, the last day: no offence made out.
#ASSERT `Under section 1098E(3), have I committed an offence by not notifying the registrar of the change in my supervisory authority in time` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) TRUE (Date 14 3 2026) (Date 30 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- I have a reasonable excuse: not covered on the Act's wording.
#ASSERT `Under section 1098E(3), have I committed an offence by not notifying the registrar of the change in my supervisory authority in time` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 30 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- I am not an authorised corporate service provider.
#ASSERT `Under section 1098E(3), have I committed an offence by not notifying the registrar of the change in my supervisory authority in time` FALSE FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 30 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
