#ASSERT `Under section 1098E(4), as an officer of an authorised corporate service provider that is a firm, have I also committed the offence` `a company registered under the Companies Act 2006` TRUE `s 1121(2)(a) a director` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The offence was committed by an individual, not a firm.
