-- Scotland, first conviction (level 5 taken as 1,000 for this test): the fine limit is level 5.
#ASSERT `Under section 1098E(5), what is the most I can be fined on summary conviction for failing to notify the registrar of the change` Scotland FALSE 0 1000 EQUALS JUST 1000
-- Scotland, second conviction, 3 days: one-tenth of 1,000 a day, 300.
