#ASSERT `Under section 1213(3), am I guilty of an offence for acting while ineligible or for not giving the notice` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 1213(3), am I guilty of an offence for acting while ineligible or for not giving the notice` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 1213(4): on summary conviction in England and Wales the most is the statutory maximum (an input); on indictment no figure
#ASSERT `Under section 1213(4), what is the most I can be fined for that offence, in pounds` `on summary conviction in England and Wales` 5000 EQUALS JUST 5000
#ASSERT `Under section 1213(4), what is the most I can be fined for that offence, in pounds` `on summary conviction` 10000 EQUALS JUST 10000
#ASSERT `Under section 1213(4), what is the most I can be fined for that offence, in pounds` `on conviction on indictment` 5000 EQUALS NOTHING
