-- coa27-cases-seat.l4: cases for the seat layer coa27-seat.l4, each stated with the facts a person in the seat would give. The expected value
-- of each case was decided from the text of the section named, and is written beside the assertion. Amounts are illustrative inputs.

-- ---- s 1239(3): what the register entry of a firm shows about the people behind it
-- A body corporate that is not an LLP: each director and each person who holds shares in it
#ASSERT `Under section 1239(3), what must the register entry of a firm show about its directors, shareholders, members or partners` `s 1239(3)(a) a body corporate other than a limited liability partnership` EQUALS `s 1239(3)(a) the name and address of each person who is a director of the body or holds any shares in it`
#ASSERT `Under section 1239(3), what must the register entry of a firm show about its directors, shareholders, members or partners` `s 1239(3)(b) a limited liability partnership` EQUALS `s 1239(3)(b) the name and address of each member of the partnership`
#ASSERT `Under section 1239(3), what must the register entry of a firm show about its directors, shareholders, members or partners` `s 1239(3)(c) a corporation sole` EQUALS `s 1239(3)(c) the name and address of the individual for the time being holding the office by the name of which he is the corporation sole`
#ASSERT `Under section 1239(3), what must the register entry of a firm show about its directors, shareholders, members or partners` `s 1239(3)(d) a partnership` EQUALS `s 1239(3)(d) the name and address of each partner`

