-- ---- s 1270 (FSMA 90A): an investor's claim. Arguments in order: report in response to Art 4/5/6; preliminary statement; its information intended; same form;
--      securities on a UK RM; on an RM outside the UK; UK is home Member State; I acquired; contracted to acquire; contracted for an interest;
--      loss from an untrue statement; loss from an omission; a PDMR knew/reckless as to the statement; a PDMR knew the omission was dishonest concealment; relied; reasonable to rely
-- every element met: a report under Article 4, UK-traded securities, acquired, loss from an untrue statement, a director was reckless, relied reasonably
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no reliance: a loss is not regarded as suffered as a result unless the person relied
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- reliance that was not reasonable
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the issuer is liable only if a person discharging managerial responsibilities knew or was reckless
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- I did not acquire the securities: the liability in subsection (3) does not reach me
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- acquisition includes contracting to acquire them
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a loss from an omission, through a preliminary statement whose information was meant to appear in substantially the same form
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- securities traded on a regulated market outside the UK, the UK being the issuer's home Member State
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- securities traded on a regulated market outside the UK, the UK not the home Member State: not within subsection (2), so subsection (3) does not reach
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A), is the issuer liable to pay me compensation for my loss` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the directors: not subject to any liability to investors other than to the issuer, unless subsection (8) applies
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A(6)), is a director of the issuer subject to any liability to an investor for the investor's loss` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 1270 (FSMA 90A(6)), is a director of the issuer subject to any liability to an investor for the investor's loss` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

