#ASSERT (`Under schedule 5 paragraph 17(3), may the company send the document in the way it could have before the death or bankruptcy` WITH `the holder has died or become bankrupt` IS TRUE, `those claiming have supplied an address in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `it is sent in a manner open before the death or bankruptcy` IS TRUE, `the articles provide otherwise` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an address has been supplied: the 'until' bar has ended
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 5 paragraph 17(3), may the company send the document in the way it could have before the death or bankruptcy` WITH `the holder has died or become bankrupt` IS TRUE, `those claiming have supplied an address in the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `it is sent in a manner open before the death or bankruptcy` IS TRUE, `the articles provide otherwise` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the holder has not died or become bankrupt: the paragraph does not apply
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 5 paragraph 17(3), may the company send the document in the way it could have before the death or bankruptcy` WITH `the holder has died or become bankrupt` IS FALSE, `those claiming have supplied an address in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `it is sent in a manner open before the death or bankruptcy` IS TRUE, `the articles provide otherwise` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the articles provide otherwise: the paragraph has effect subject to them
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 5 paragraph 17(3), may the company send the document in the way it could have before the death or bankruptcy` WITH `the holder has died or become bankrupt` IS TRUE, `those claiming have supplied an address in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `it is sent in a manner open before the death or bankruptcy` IS TRUE, `the articles provide otherwise` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Schedule 6 -- when another company is the holding company of my company (rights that count)`

-- my company has a share capital; shareholders' rights, at general meetings, on all or substantially all matters
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraph 2, are the rights voting rights in my company` WITH `the company has a share capital` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the company` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the votes are only on some matters
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraph 2, are the rights voting rights in my company` WITH `the company has a share capital` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the company` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- it can appoint directors holding 3 of 4 board votes
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraph 3(1), does the other company have the right to appoint or remove a majority of my board` WITH `the votes held by the directors it can appoint or remove` IS 3, `all the votes at board meetings` IS 4, `the votes are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 2 of 4 is not a majority
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraph 3(1), does the other company have the right to appoint or remove a majority of my board` WITH `the votes held by the directors it can appoint or remove` IS 2, `all the votes at board meetings` IS 4, `the votes are on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- needs consent but no other person has a right
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraph 3(3), is a right that needs another person's consent counted` WITH `the right needs another person's consent or concurrence` IS TRUE, `no other person has a right to appoint or remove for that directorship` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- needs consent and another person has a right
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraph 3(3), is a right that needs another person's consent counted` WITH `the right needs another person's consent or concurrence` IS TRUE, `no other person has a right to appoint or remove for that directorship` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- does not need consent
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraph 3(3), is a right that needs another person's consent counted` WITH `the right needs another person's consent or concurrence` IS FALSE, `no other person has a right to appoint or remove for that directorship` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Paras 5 to 8: fiduciary rights are not the holder's; nominee rights are the other's; security rights are the provider's where para 7's conditions hold; a subsidiary's rights are the holding company's.
-- the other company holds them itself
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held beneficially`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- its subsidiary holds them (para 8(1))
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 a subsidiary company of the other company`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held beneficially`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the other company holds them in a fiduciary capacity (para 5)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held in a fiduciary capacity`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a third party holds them as nominee for the other company (para 6(1))
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held as nominee for the other company`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the other company holds them as nominee for someone else (para 6(1))
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held as nominee for someone else`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- held by a lender as security provided by the other company; instructions and interests are the other company's; loans in normal business (para 7)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held by way of security provided by the other company`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- held by a lender as security provided by the other company; the para 7 conditions are not met: the rights stay with the lender
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held by way of security provided by the other company`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the other company holds as security provided by someone else; para 7 conditions met: the provider's, not the other company's
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held by way of security provided by someone else`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- conditional rights not yet exercisable and not within the holder's control: left out of account (para 4)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held beneficially`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS TRUE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- conditional rights whose circumstances have arisen
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 the other company itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held beneficially`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS TRUE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS TRUE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- held beneficially by someone else: not attributed by this Schedule
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraphs 4 to 10, is this block of rights treated as held by the other company` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 6 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 6 held beneficially`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a company in the provider's group` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 9: reduced by the rights held by the company itself.
-- 100 voting rights; the company itself holds 10
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 6 paragraph 9, how many voting rights are there in my company after the reduction` WITH `the voting rights in the company` IS 100, `the rights held by the company itself` IS 10) EQUALS JUST 90
