§§ `Schedule 7 -- when another undertaking is a parent undertaking of mine (rights that count)`

-- an undertaking with a share capital; shareholders' rights at general meetings on all or substantially all matters
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 2(1), are the rights voting rights in the undertaking` WITH `the undertaking has a share capital` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the undertaking` IS TRUE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the rights are not to vote at general meetings
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 2(1), are the rights voting rights in the undertaking` WITH `the undertaking has a share capital` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on shareholders in respect of their shares` IS TRUE, `the rights are conferred on members` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote at general meetings of the undertaking` IS FALSE, `the rights are to vote on all, or substantially all, matters` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no general meetings; the other undertaking may direct its overall policy under the constitution
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 2(2), does the other undertaking hold a majority of the voting rights in an undertaking with no general meetings` WITH `the undertaking has general meetings that decide matters by votes` IS FALSE, `the other undertaking has the right under the constitution to direct the overall policy` IS TRUE, `the other undertaking has the right under the constitution to alter the constitution` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no general meetings; neither right
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 2(2), does the other undertaking hold a majority of the voting rights in an undertaking with no general meetings` WITH `the undertaking has general meetings that decide matters by votes` IS FALSE, `the other undertaking has the right under the constitution to direct the overall policy` IS FALSE, `the other undertaking has the right under the constitution to alter the constitution` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the undertaking does have general meetings
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 2(2), does the other undertaking hold a majority of the voting rights in an undertaking with no general meetings` WITH `the undertaking has general meetings that decide matters by votes` IS TRUE, `the other undertaking has the right under the constitution to direct the overall policy` IS TRUE, `the other undertaking has the right under the constitution to alter the constitution` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 4(1): barred unless it has a right to give directions on operating and financial policies that the directors must obey whether or not they benefit the undertaking.
-- it has a right to give directions but my directors are not obliged to obey: the bar applies
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 4(1), is the other undertaking barred from being regarded as having a dominant influence over mine` WITH `it has a right to give directions on operating and financial policies` IS TRUE, `my directors are obliged to comply with them whether or not they benefit my undertaking` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- it has the right and my directors are so obliged: the 'unless' is met, the bar does not apply
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 4(1), is the other undertaking barred from being regarded as having a dominant influence over mine` WITH `it has a right to give directions on operating and financial policies` IS TRUE, `my directors are obliged to comply with them whether or not they benefit my undertaking` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- in writing; confers the right; authorised by the articles; permitted by the law of establishment
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 4(2), is the contract a control contract` WITH `the contract is in writing` IS TRUE, `the contract gives the right to give directions on operating and financial policies` IS TRUE, `my articles authorise a contract of that kind` IS TRUE, `the law that governs my undertaking permits it` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not in writing
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 4(2), is the contract a control contract` WITH `the contract is in writing` IS FALSE, `the contract gives the right to give directions on operating and financial policies` IS TRUE, `my articles authorise a contract of that kind` IS TRUE, `the law that governs my undertaking permits it` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the other undertaking holds them itself
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 the parent undertaking itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held beneficially`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- its subsidiary undertaking holds them (para 9(1))
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 a subsidiary undertaking of the parent undertaking`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held beneficially`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- held in a fiduciary capacity (para 6)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 the parent undertaking itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held in a fiduciary capacity`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a third party holds them as nominee for the other undertaking (para 7(1))
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held as nominee for the parent undertaking`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- held as nominee for someone else
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 the parent undertaking itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held as nominee for someone else`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- security provided by the other undertaking; the lender follows its instructions and interests and lends in normal business (para 8)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held by way of security provided by the parent undertaking`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- security provided by the other undertaking; the lender follows a group undertaking's instructions and interests (para 9(3), s 1161(5) yes)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held by way of security provided by the parent undertaking`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS TRUE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS TRUE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the same, but the instructing undertaking is not a group undertaking: para 8 not met, the rights stay with the lender
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 someone else`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held by way of security provided by the parent undertaking`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS FALSE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS TRUE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS TRUE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS TRUE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS TRUE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- conditional rights not yet exercisable and not within the holder's control (para 5)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraphs 5 to 11, is this block of rights treated as held by the other undertaking` WITH `who holds the rights` IS `sch 7 the parent undertaking itself`, `how the rights are held` IS `sch 7 held beneficially`, `the rights can be exercised only in certain circumstances` IS TRUE, `those circumstances have arisen and continue` IS FALSE, `those circumstances are within the control of the person having the rights` IS FALSE, `the rights are normally exercisable but temporarily cannot be` IS FALSE, `the shares are held by way of security` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the provider's instructions (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only on the instructions of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `held in connection with loans as part of normal business activities` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the provider's interests (apart from preserving or realising the security)` IS FALSE, `exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE, `the instructing undertaking is a group undertaking of the provider` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 100 voting rights; the undertaking itself holds 25
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 7 paragraph 10, how many voting rights are there in the undertaking after the reduction` WITH `the voting rights in the undertaking` IS 100, `the rights held by the undertaking itself` IS 25) EQUALS JUST 75
