§§ `Schedule 8 -- where the Act defines an expression`

-- Lines 19719 to 19724 of the text: the index entries for director.
-- director
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 8, which provisions define or explain the expression` WITH `expression` IS "director") EQUALS JUST (LIST "generally in the Companies Acts: section 250", "in Chapter 8 of Part 10: section 240(3)", "in Chapter 1 of Part 11: section 260(5)", "in Chapter 2 of Part 11: section 265(7)", "in Part 14: section 379(1)")
-- holding company (line 19777)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 8, which provisions define or explain the expression` WITH `expression` IS "holding company") EQUALS JUST (LIST "section 1159 (and see section 1160 and Schedule 6)")
