-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions from part coa30 (merged by the lead on 2026-11-12; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- coa30-cases-seat.l4: cases for the questions of coa30-seat.l4: facts a real person in the seat would state, and the answer
-- the text gives, decided from the paragraph before running. Every question has at least one case, and a case that falls
-- outside the encoding (NOTHING), or the Act's own no (JUST FALSE), where the question has one.

§ `Cases: the seat for Schedules 10 to 16`

